From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 19:59:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 56/59] POC-17a: the Omega legendaries fight with the Omega AI

NET CHALLENGE boss battles (Groudon, Kyogre, Rayquaza) set sB.omega: aims ahead, counter-chips,
punishes end lag, guards against PAs and GigaChips, faster and more evasive, earlier PAs, and the
red Omega banner.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
---
 src/pkbn/grid_battle.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/pkbn/grid_battle.c b/src/pkbn/grid_battle.c
index 763eca3..97cd40d 100644
--- a/src/pkbn/grid_battle.c
+++ b/src/pkbn/grid_battle.c
@@ -921,6 +921,7 @@ static void Begin(void)
             // POC-16e Omega legendaries: the boss battle's phases and signature PA (POC-14h)
             sB.boss = BossOf(c->mons[0].species);
             sB.bossTimer = sB.fastPhases ? BOSS_PHASE_FRAMES_LOW / 2 : BOSS_PHASE_FRAMES / 2;
+            sB.omega = TRUE;   // POC-17a: the Omega legendaries fight with the Omega AI (Khaled)
         }
         PKBN_LOG("net challenge %u: %s, tier %u, %u at once, %u s, rules %x", sB.challenge - 1, c->name, c->tier, c->together,
                  c->seconds, c->rules);
